7
00:00:12,930 --> 00:00:14,870
(Bernadette:)Honey, if you're
that tired,

8
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:17,370
(Bernadette:)why don't you just take
a nap here in the car?

9
00:00:17,370 --> 00:00:19,000
(Howard:)No, see, it's not...

10
00:00:19,010 --> 00:00:20,910
(Bernadette:)Hang on.
It's Leonard.

11
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:22,940
(Bernadette:)Hi, Leonard.

12
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:25,740
(Penny:)LEONARD
Yeah, hi. Listen, I just
got a text from Raj.

13
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:26,980
(Leonard(voice):)He wanted me to tell you

14
