(Bernadette:)Thank you, Raj.

16
00:00:35,390 --> 00:00:39,260
(Leonard:)Are you... an element
in the actinoid series?

17
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:40,530
(Sheldon:)No.

18
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:41,730
