20
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:45,930
(Sheldon:)No.

21
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:47,530
(Amy:)Are you in the
lanthanoid series?

22
00:00:47,530 --> 00:00:49,470
(Sheldon:)Amy, it's Penny's turn.

23
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,400
(Sheldon:)Penny?

24
00:00:52,410 --> 00:00:54,640
(Penny:)Uh, I don't know...

25
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:56,010
